#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 4.** Train the quantum-enhanced classifier using the [`fit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#fit) action.\n"
msgstr "**ขั้นตอนที่ 4.** เทรน quantum-enhanced classifier โดยใช้ action [`fit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#fit)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
